      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-13T10:33:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The netd functions really seem very simple and the quota IPCs and rule IPCs don\u0027t seem to interact with each other at all. While it\u0027s possible that OEMs have modified that code, that seems very unlikely. So I think this is fine.",
